safix::generate_needs_nixpkgs

  × generate needs a flake or a declared nixpkgs reference.
  │ 
  │ A generator's sandbox resolves its own tools through nix shell, which
  │ is a flake-only operation. This run named --entry, which points at a
  │ plain file rather than a flake, and named no --nixpkgs or
  │ SAFIX_NIXPKGS for the sandbox to resolve its tools against instead.
  │ 
  │ Drop --entry and run against the declaring flake, or add --nixpkgs
  │ <flake-ref> (or SAFIX_NIXPKGS).
